{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/263","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/263/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/263/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/263/events","html_url":"https://github.com/graphql/graphql-js/issues/263","id":121208242,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMjEyMDgyNDI=","number":263,"title":"Fields with same arguments from different variables can't be merged","user":{"login":"fson","id":497214,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzIxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/497214?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson","html_url":"https://github.com/fson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2015-12-09T10:38:15Z","updated_at":"2016-02-02T03:46:29Z","closed_at":"2016-02-02T03:46:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"graphql-js merges overlapping fields when they have the same arguments, but not if the values come from different variables, even if the variables have the same value.\n\nFor example, given variables: `{ \"orderBy\": \"NAME_ASC\", \"orderBy2\": \"NAME_ASC\" }` this merges without problems:\n\n```\nquery ($orderBy: _GroupOrdering) {\n  viewer {\n    allGroups(orderBy: $orderBy) { count }\n    allGroups(orderBy: $orderBy) { count }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nBut this fails with `Fields \"allGroups\" conflict because they have differing arguments.`:\n\n```\nquery ($orderBy: _GroupOrdering, $orderBy2: _GroupOrdering) {\n  viewer {\n    allGroups(orderBy: $orderBy) { count }\n    allGroups(orderBy: $orderBy2) { count }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThis is an issue when using Relay because it can produce queries like this in some cases.\n\nThe relevant line of code seems to be here: https://github.com/graphql/graphql-js/blob/a6bcc75d3c19ce31847cd77279a41fbc6ac032d2/src/validation/rules/OverlappingFieldsCanBeMerged.js#L209 It only compares the names of variables. Should we also take the variable values in account when validating if the fields can be merged?\n","closed_by":{"login":"leebyron","id":50130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron","html_url":"https://github.com/leebyron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leebyron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/263/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/263/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}